<title>GERMANY: German bank labour talks adjourned until Feb 10.</title>
<headline>German bank labour talks adjourned until Feb 10.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Talks over the sick pay dispute in the German banking sector have been adjourned to February 10, a spokesman for the Federation of Banking Employers said.</p>
<p>He added there had been some progress in the talks on Wednesday and that the issue of continued payment of full sick pay and possible labour cost reductions had been discussed.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
</text>
